&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Manager, D2C - Change &amp;amp; Go-To-Market&lt;br&gt;San Mateo, CA (hybrid)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment (PlayStation) is seeking a Change &amp;amp; GTM Commercial Manager to shape and deliver strategic e-commerce initiatives at global scale. This role goes beyond project delivery: you will turn customer, market, and trading insights into clear commercial strategies and own the end-to-end go-to-market lifecycle, from opportunity sizing and value proposition through launch, adoption, retention, and continuous optimization. You will help improve how players discover, evaluate, purchase, and engage with PlayStation products and services across the Direct to Consumer (D2C) business. You will partner with Product, Engineering, Merchandising, Marketing, Analytics, Data Science, Finance, Legal, and Operations to deliver measurable customer and commercial value.&amp;nbsp;This role requires a commercially minded, data-savvy operator who can frame ambiguous problems, work hands-on with data, influence strategic choices, and translate insight into execution with pace and agility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape e-commerce and GTM strategy - &lt;/strong&gt;define the customer problem, identify priority segments, and shape the value proposition, market sequencing, channel approach, and commercial roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive analytical decision-making - &lt;/strong&gt;analyze customer journeys, growth funnels, trading performance, and behavioral data to identify opportunities, diagnose performance gaps, and recommend clear actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build commercial cases and KPI frameworks&lt;/strong&gt; -&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;forecast and monitor outcomes including traffic, acquisition, conversion, basket size and average order value, purchase frequency, repeat purchase, LTV, and incremental revenue; use the evidence to guide investment and prioritization choices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embed experimentation and personalization &lt;/strong&gt;- partner with Product, Marketing, Analytics, and Data Science to design A/B tests, apply segmentation and predictive insights, and improve customer relevance and conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the full GTM lifecycle - &lt;/strong&gt;connect commercial strategy to launch planning, customer activation, market readiness, adoption, retention, learning, and continuous optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create performance visibility - &lt;/strong&gt;build dashboards, decision-ready reporting, and review rhythms that turn data into recommendations, owners, and measurable performance improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead cross-functional orchestration and change - &lt;/strong&gt;align global teams around customer outcomes, commercial goals, decisions, risks, dependencies, and business readiness; influence stakeholders through clear analysis and compelling narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build scalable e-commerce playbooks -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;codify repeatable approaches for segmentation, proposition development, launch, experimentation, adoption, optimization, and transfer into business-as-usual ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience&amp;nbsp;in management consulting, commercial strategy, e-commerce, digital commerce, growth, product, or Go-To-Market; experience supporting transactional e-commerce, digital storefronts, Direct-to-Consumer, technology, games, or entertainment is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial modelling experience&amp;nbsp;including opportunity sizing, forecasting, scenario analysis, business-case development, and assessing incremental revenue and customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on analytical capability&amp;nbsp;including working with SQL, Tableau or similar BI tools, spreadsheets, KPI modelling, segmentation, funnel diagnostics, and AI-enabled analytical tools to generate actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured, hypothesis-driven problem-solving&amp;nbsp;with the ability to bring clarity to complexity, test assumptions, and make practical recommendations from incomplete information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with experimentation and optimization&amp;nbsp;including A/B testing, test design, measurement, and using results to improve customer journeys and commercial performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong e-commerce and customer-lifecycle understanding&amp;nbsp;including digital storefronts, merchandising, offers and promotions, acquisition, conversion, checkout, basket value, repeat purchase, and personalized customer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to connect strategy to execution&amp;nbsp;translating insight into clear choices, roadmaps, operating plans, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional leadership&amp;nbsp;with the communication, facilitation, and stakeholder-management skills to influence product and business decisions at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading business readiness and change&amp;nbsp;for new digital capabilities, customer propositions, or commercial operating models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product management or agile delivery experience&amp;nbsp;is a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we value:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pace and agility&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to react and adjust to changing customer and business needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for delivering measurable business and customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to explore data, challenge assumptions, and translate insight into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial judgment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to balance customer value, business impact, pace, and practical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A growth mindset&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;and commitment to experimentation and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Respect&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for diverse perspectives, backgrounds, and experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to collaboration, transparency, and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong voice&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for the customer and the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-SF1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At SIE, we consider several factors when setting each role’s base pay range, including the competitive benchmarking data for the market and geographic location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the base pay range may vary in line with our hybrid working policy and individual base pay will be determined based on job-related factors which may include knowledge, skills, experience, and location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition, this role &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;is eligible&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; for SIE’s top-tier benefits package that includes medical, dental, vision, matching 401(k), paid time off, wellness program and coveted employee discounts for Sony products. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role also may be eligible for a bonus package.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Click&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.playstation.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; to learn more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The estimated base pay range for this role is listed below.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$131,400&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$197,200 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;In May 2021, we embarked on a journey to start &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.havenstudios.com/en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Haven Studios&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt; with a small team and big ambitions. Our goal was to build a studio where we could make the kind of games we’ve always wanted to create – and games we’ve longed to play.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;We established a culture at Haven grounded in kindness, adaptability and courage that unlocks creativity. Our first new IP for PlayStation is on track to deliver a AAA multiplayer experience with a vision to build a systemic and evolving world focused on freedom, thrill, and playfulness that will keep players entertained and engaged for years.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Haven joined &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2022-03-21/sony-entertainment-to-acquire-jade-raymond-s-haven-studio&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;the PlayStation Studios family&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt; in 2022, and we are on track to build an exclusive new IP for Playstation and grow the first Sony game development team in Canada.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;We are seeking an incredibly organized, logistics-driven &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Character Content Manager &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;to ensure our Character Art pipeline runs efficiently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;You do not need to be a formal people manager. Instead, your strength lies in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;world-class project management, pipeline optimization, and asset logistics&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;. In this role, you will coordinate the massive influx of daily assets flowing from multiple global external development and outsourcing partners. Your focus is to ensure our character artists can focus on quality while you handle the complex traffic of schedule alignment, tracker integration, risk mitigation, and feedback loops.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Asset Traffic Control &amp;amp; Logistics:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Oversee the day-to-day intake, triage, and pipeline routing of dozens of daily character art assets (high-poly, low-poly, textures, rigs, blendshapes) arriving from external vendors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Outsourcing &amp;amp; Vendor Integration:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Partner closely with internal character art leads and external vendors.Partner closely with internal character art leads and external vendors. Establish clear delivery milestones, track SLAs and ensure optimized timeline is precisely met by outsourcers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Pipeline &amp;amp; Workflow Optimization:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Design, maintain, and ruthlessly optimize the tracking systems (Jira, Shotgrid/Flow Production Tracking, Confluence) used to monitor asset lifecycles from concept to engine-ready implementation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Dependency &amp;amp; Risk Management:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Proactively identify bottlenecks across cross-disciplinary dependencies (e.g., ensuring character art handoffs to Rigging, Animation, and Tech Art happen smoothly without stalling production).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Feedback Loop Management:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Facilitate communication between internal Art Directors/Leads, external partners and Producers of other teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sprint Planning &amp;amp; Status Reporting:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Own the sprint schedules for the character team. Maintain clear visibility on asset readiness metrics and escalate potential timeline risks to the Lead Producer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;AAA Production Experience:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Proven experience operating within a full-cycle, large-scale AAA game production environment, specifically managing content-heavy pipelines (Art, Maps, Outsourcing, or Asset Management).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mastery of Project Management Frameworks:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Deep practical knowledge of Agile, Scrum, or Waterfall methodologies adapted for game production pipelines. You know how to build a milestone plan that accounts for the unpredictability of art iterations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tool Proficiency:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Expert-level mastery of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Jira&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; (including custom workflows, automation, and advanced filtering) and asset tracking tools like &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shotgrid/Flow, Miro, or Airtable&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Outsourcing Literacy:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Deep understanding of how external development partnerships function. You know how to read asset specification sheets, manage vendor milestones, and run an efficient delivery process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Exceptional Communication &amp;amp; Diplomacy:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; The ability to navigate ambiguity and communicate seamlessly across technical, creative, and external business teams. You can push for deadlines while keeping relationships healthy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Passion for Asset Mechanics:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; While you don&#39;t need to be an artist, you should have a solid understanding of the game art pipeline lifecycle&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;BONUS POINTS:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Experience shipping a Live-Service or Games As A Service (GaaS) title.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Experience with 3d Software&amp;nbsp; (maya, blender etc)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Experience with Perforce/Helix Core or engine integration tools (Unreal Engine).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Bilingualism (English and French), given our studio&#39;s location in Montreal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Character art experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;BIG&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; bonus for knowing Python scripting/having experience coding your own tool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;En mai 2021, nous nous sommes lancés dans la création de Haven Studios avec une petite équipe et de grandes ambitions. Notre objectif était de construire un studio où nous pourrions créer le genre de jeux que nous avons toujours voulu créer - et auxquels nous avons toujours rêvé de jouer ! Nous faisons désormais partie de la famille PlayStations Studios et nous sommes fiers d&#39;avoir l&#39;opportunité de créer une nouvelle propriété intellectuelle exclusive pour Playstation et de former la première équipe de développement Sony au Canada.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Nous avons fait des progrès étonnants en peu de temps grâce à notre équipe talentueuse et passionnée et à ses contributions exceptionnelles. Nous avons instauré chez Haven une culture fondée sur la bienveillance, l&#39;adaptabilité et le courage qui libère la créativité. Notre première nouvelle propriété intellectuelle pour PlayStation est sur la bonne voie pour offrir une expérience multijoueur de niveau AAA, avec la vision de construire un monde systémique et évolutif axé sur la liberté, le frisson et le jeu, qui gardera les joueur&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;·euse·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;s diverti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;·e·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;s et engagé&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;·e·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;s pendant des années.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Haven a rejoint la famille des studios PlayStations en 2022, et nous sommes sur la bonne voie pour créer une nouvelle propriété intellectuelle exclusive pour Playstation et continuer de bâtir la première équipe de développement de jeux Sony au Canada.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Le rôle&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Nous recherchons un(e) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gestionnaire de contenu – Personnages (Character Content Manager)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp; organisé(e) et orienté(e) vers l’éfficacité afin d’assurer l’efficacité de notre pipeline de production en Character Art.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Il n’est pas nécessaire d’avoir une expérience formelle en gestion d’équipe. Vos principales forces résident plutôt dans &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;une excellente gestion de projet, l’optimisation des pipelines et la coordination des assets&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Dans ce rôle, vous coordonnerez un volume important d’assets produits quotidiennement par notre équipe interne et plusieurs partenaires internationaux en développement externe. Votre objectif sera de permettre à nos artistes de se concentrer sur la qualité du contenu pendant que vous prenez en charge la complexité opérationnelle : alignement des échéanciers, intégration et gestion des outils de suivi, gestion des risques et coordination des boucles de feedback.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Principales responsabilités&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Coordination et logistique des assets :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Superviser quotidiennement la réception, le triage et l’acheminement dans le pipeline de dizaines d’assets de personnages provenant de partenaires externes (high-poly, low-poly, textures, rigs, blendshapes).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Outsourcing et intégration des partenaires :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Collaborer étroitement avec les Leads Character Art internes et les partenaires externes. Établir des jalons de livraison clairs, suivre les engagements de service (SLA) et s’assurer que les partenaires d’outsourcing respectent les échéanciers établis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Optimisation des pipelines et workflows :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Concevoir, maintenir et optimiser continuellement les systèmes de suivi (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Jira, ShotGrid/Flow Production Tracking, Confluence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;) permettant de suivre le cycle de vie des assets, du concept jusqu’à leur intégration finale dans le moteur.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gestion des dépendances et des risques :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Identifier de façon proactive les goulots d’étranglement et les risques liés aux dépendances multidisciplinaires, notamment pour assurer des transitions fluides entre Character Art, Rigging, Animation et Tech Art sans ralentir la production.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gestion des boucles de feedback :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Faciliter la communication et le suivi des feedbacks entre les directeurs et Leads Art internes, les partenaires externes et les Producers des autres équipes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Planification des sprints et suivi de production :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Prendre en charge la planification des sprints de l’équipe Character. Maintenir une visibilité claire sur l’état de préparation des assets et faire remonter au Lead Producer les risques pouvant affecter les échéanciers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Profil recherché&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Expérience en production AAA :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Expérience démontrée dans un environnement de production AAA à grande échelle et sur l’ensemble du cycle de développement, particulièrement dans la gestion de pipelines à fort volume de contenu (Art, Maps, Outsourcing ou Asset Management).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Maîtrise des méthodologies de gestion de projet :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Solide expérience pratique des méthodologies &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Agile, Scrum ou Waterfall&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;, adaptées aux réalités de la production de jeux vidéo. Vous savez construire un plan de jalons qui tient compte de la nature imprévisible et itérative de la production artistique.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Maîtrise des outils :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Excellente maîtrise de &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Jira&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;, notamment des workflows personnalisés, de l’automatisation et des filtres avancés, ainsi que d’outils de suivi des assets tels que &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;ShotGrid/Flow, Miro ou Airtable&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Expérience en outsourcing :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Très bonne compréhension du fonctionnement des partenariats de développement externe. Vous savez interpréter des spécifications d’assets, gérer les jalons avec les partenaires et mettre en place un processus de livraison efficace.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Communication et diplomatie :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Capacité à évoluer dans des contextes ambigus et à communiquer efficacement avec des équipes techniques, créatives et des partenaires externes. Vous êtes capable de maintenir la pression nécessaire sur les échéanciers tout en préservant de bonnes relations de collaboration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Compréhension du pipeline de production d’assets :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; Sans nécessairement être artiste, vous possédez une bonne compréhension du cycle de vie et des différentes étapes d’un pipeline de production artistique pour un jeu vidéo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Atouts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Expérience sur un jeu &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Live Service / Games as a Service (GaaS)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Expérience avec des logiciels 3D tels que &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Maya ou Blender&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Expérience avec &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Perforce/Helix Core&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; ou des outils d’intégration dans un moteur comme &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Unreal Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Bilinguisme &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;français/anglais&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;, compte tenu de la localisation de notre studio à Montréal.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Expérience en &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Character Art&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;b&gt;Atout majeur :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; connaissance du scripting &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Python&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt; ou expérience en programmation et en développement de vos propres outils.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;At PlayStation, we are passionate about delivering high-quality experiences to millions of players worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced, hands-on Software Development Engineer in Test II (SDET II) to help build reliable, scalable Subscription and Streaming experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;This opportunity is suited for an engineer who enjoys solving complex technical problems, developing automation solutions, and improving quality across applications, services, and connected platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;As an SDET , you will collaborate with Software Engineers, Product Managers, and Quality Engineering teams to deliver subscription experiences across PlayStation platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;You will take ownership of testing and automation for assigned features, contribute to technical solutions, and help improve how quality is built into the development process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Your work will span subscription and commerce services, backend APIs, mobile applications, gaming consoles, streaming services, and connected device experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;You will have opportunities to expand your technical expertise while working with experienced engineers across multiple teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and improve automated testing solutions for subscription services, applications, and connected platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Take ownership of quality engineering activities for assigned features, from test planning through automation and release validation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with engineering teams early in development to identify quality risks, improve testability, and determine effective testing approaches.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Develop reusable automation tools and framework capabilities that improve test coverage, reliability, and engineering efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Validate end-to-end customer journeys involving authentication, commerce, entitlements, subscription lifecycle management, retention, and streaming experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Build automated tests for APIs, backend services, distributed systems, web applications, and native mobile platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Integrate automated testing into CI/CD pipelines and contribute to improving test execution reliability and feedback.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Investigate complex failures, analyze root causes, and work with engineering teams to resolve issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Contribute to quality metrics, dashboards, and reporting that provide visibility into automation coverage and release readiness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Identify opportunities to improve testing practices, reduce technical debt, and strengthen overall product quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with globally distributed engineering and QE teams on integration testing and release qualification.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Explore emerging technologies, including AI-assisted testing, to improve test development and engineering workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;3+ years of experience in Software Development Engineering in Test, Software Engineering, Quality Engineering, or Test Automation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in at least one programming language, such as Python, JavaScript/TypeScript, or Swift.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience developing automated tests and working with test automation frameworks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience testing APIs, backend services, web applications, or native mobile applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Understanding of software testing methodologies, test design, and automation strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD pipelines, version control, and modern software development practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience investigating technical issues, debugging failures, and collaborating with engineering teams on solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Ability to manage assigned work independently, communicate technical findings, and collaborate across teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience with subscription platforms, commerce systems, payment processing, or entitlement services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience testing distributed systems, microservices, or cloud-based applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience with automation technologies such as XCUITest, Appium, Selenium, or API testing frameworks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Jenkins, GitHub Actions, Docker, Kubernetes, or similar development tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience testing streaming services, media playback, gaming consoles, or connected devices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience with React Native or other cross-platform application frameworks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience developing end-to-end automation across client applications and backend services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with observability, telemetry, and quality reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Exposure to AI-assisted testing and automation tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Understanding of accessibility and localization testing practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;You enjoy understanding how systems work and finding practical ways to improve their quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;You are comfortable working across different technologies, investigating complex issues, and translating requirements into effective testing solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;You bring hands-on engineering experience, take ownership of your work, and collaborate with others to solve problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;You are interested in continuing to develop your technical expertise while contributing to reliable, high-quality PlayStation experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
