&lt;p&gt;Anyone using an email that is not @sony.com is&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;not affiliated with us&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;and should be&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;reported&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;either&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;via the platform&amp;nbsp;they are contacting you&amp;nbsp;on&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;directly to your email service&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;as a phishing attempt/scam.&lt;/p&gt;
