&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Do you want to help bring PlayStation technology to a worldwide audience? Are you passionate about securing infrastructure that constantly pushes the boundary of the gaming industry? Are you ready to work with innovative technology, forward-thinking engineers, and a passionate security team? If so, join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;The role is a senior-level application security position combining strong technical expertise with leadership, initiative, and collaboration. You will provide strategic mentorship and hands-on support in designing, implementing, and testing secure solutions that strengthen PlayStation products and services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;As a technical leader within Product Security, you’ll guide practices and influence multiple teams to embed security throughout the software development lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Lead security initiatives across the SDLC and improve development practices through scalable automation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Conduct and guide threat modeling and security requirements early in design phases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Partner with developers, architects, and product managers to align business goals with security needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Lead security architecture and code reviews for distributed systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Perform hands-on testing to identify risks and drive remediation with vulnerability and incident response teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Advance the Product Security strategy through multi-functional initiatives and cultural influence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Balance business and security risks through technically grounded, pragmatic recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Translate lessons learned into reusable organizational assets that enhance overall security posture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Mentor engineers and practitioners, promoting secure-by-default thinking and shared accountability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Demonstrate proactive leadership, coordinating teams to deliver measurable security and business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;7+ years in information security and 3+ years in software development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent in Computer Science, Information Security, or related field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Effective communication and leadership abilities; capable of influencing technical and non-technical collaborators including management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Dedicated and proactive, finding opportunities and leading initiatives independently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of enterprise and cloud-native architectures and their secure design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Expertise in network and web protocols (TCP/IP, TLS, HTTPS, OAuth 2.0, OpenID Connect) and common attack vectors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Proven expertise in guiding security development and code evaluations and providing actionable, risk-based recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Skilled in multiple programming languages (e.g., Java, C/C++, JavaScript, Python) and mitigating vulnerabilities such as OWASP Top 10.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience integrating SAST, DAST, and dependency scanning into CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Familiar with Agile, DevOps, and modern delivery practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with cloud technologies (AWS, Azure, GCP, Kubernetes, service mesh, CDN) including secure configuration and identity management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with an attacker perspective — able to anticipate and simulate real-world attacks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience in penetration testing, automated testing, or testing frameworks (JUnit, pytest, REST Assured, Playwright).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Security certifications preferred (GIAC, OSCP, CEH, CISSP, CCSP, or equivalent).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At SIE, we consider several factors when setting each role’s base pay range, including the competitive benchmarking data for the market and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please note that the base pay range may vary in line with our hybrid working policy and individual base pay will be determined based on job-related factors which may include knowledge, skills, experience, and location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In addition, this role is eligible for SIE’s top-tier benefits package that includes medical, dental, vision, matching 401(k), paid time off, wellness program and coveted employee discounts for Sony products. This role also may be eligible for a bonus package. Click &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.playstation.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; to learn more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;This is a flexible role that can be remote, with varying pay ranges based on geographic location. For example, if you are based out of Seattle, the estimated base pay range for this role is listed below.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$177,300&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$265,900 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Business Intelligence Specialist to lead the development of high-impact&amp;nbsp;analytical solutions and cohesive data experiences that drive insight to action at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating at the intersection of business, analytics, and engineering, this role leads the translation of complex data challenges into scalable, intuitive solutions. The Sr BI Specialist serves as a senior full stack BI developer and subject matter expert within a business domain, partnering closely with the BIManager, Central BI Team, and Data Engineering to set technical direction, mentor junior team members, and ensure solutions are designed and deployed in accordance with best practices and enterprise standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analytics Strategy &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with BI Managers to shape and drive the analytics vision, strategy, and roadmap;&amp;nbsp;independently lead workstreams and influence prioritization in alignment with organizational&amp;nbsp;objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate ambiguous business questions and problems into structured, scalable analytics&amp;nbsp;solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly prototype analytics solutions to gather early stakeholder feedback and iterate&amp;nbsp;efficiently, reducing time-to-insight; serve as a model for agile delivery practices across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solution Design &amp;amp; Development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Data Engineering to architect and implement end-to-end BI solutions — from data ingestion and modeling to visualization — setting technical standards and design patterns that scale across the team and enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build performant, maintainable dashboards and reports using modern BI tooling (e.g.,DOMO, Tableau, Looker).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and optimize domain data models that underpin reliable, consistent reporting; conduct peer reviews to ensure quality and maintainability across the team’s solutions. Standardization &amp;amp; Scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively drive standardization of analytics solutions; lead initiatives with the Central BI Team to scale them into enterprise-wide capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of reusable components, templates, and frameworks for the shared analytics library, guide adoption across the BI team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion consistent KPI definitions and reporting standards within the business domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data Governance &amp;amp; Quality&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align on domain-specific data models and KPI definitions in close collaboration with the Central BI Team and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Central BI Team and Data Engineering to proactively identify, troubleshoot, and resolve data quality issues; lead root cause analyses and own remediation plans to prevent recurrence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data lineage, documentation, and governance practices are created and maintained for all owned solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stakeholder Engagement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted analytics partner to business stakeholders, translating data insights into clear, actionable narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead demos, training sessions, and enablement workshops; develop scalable self-service programs to drive broad adoption of BI tools and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and synthesize stakeholder feedback to continuously improve analytics products; translate feedback into prioritized enhancements on the team roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Education &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Statistics, Business Analytics, or a related field (or equivalent practical experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of hands-on experience in Business Intelligence, Data Analytics, or a closely related role, with demonstrated growth in scope and complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of delivering enterprise-scale analytics solutions that directly influenced strategic business decisions and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level proficiency across one or more major BI platforms — DOMO, Tableau, Looker,etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert level SQL skills — complex queries, window functions, CTEs, query optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud data platforms (e.g., Snowflake, Azure Synapse, BigQuery, Databricks).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in data modeling concepts: star/snowflake schemas, dimensional modeling, semantic layers, and performance tuning at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python or R for data wrangling and exploratory analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Business Acumen&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to decompose complex business problems into clear analytics requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and documenting KPIs and business metrics in collaboration with stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to present data-driven insights to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Soft Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills — written, verbal, and visual storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity and working iteratively with stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration skills; experience working with a COE is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter with a continuous improvement mindset and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Creative Services team shapes how millions of players experience PlayStation every day. From global campaigns to PlayStation Store, we create work that sits at the intersection of brand and performance. As our briefs evolve, so do we - moving beyond exceptional creative execution towards bigger ideas, stronger storytelling and more strategic thinking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for creatives who are excited by solving problems, shaping ideas and creating work that connects with players around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Creative Designer who combines strong visual creative skills with a passion for brand positioning, customer insight and creative strategy.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll help shape how PlayStation&#39;s digital products and services are positioned, understood and experienced by players around the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This role starts before design begins. You&#39;ll challenge briefs, uncover customer insights and turn complex offerings into clear, compelling propositions that connect functional benefits with emotional appeal.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Working alongside designers, copywriters and other creative specialists, you&#39;ll translate that thinking into distinctive visual territories, creative direction and digital brand experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll also build and present compelling creative proposals, bringing stakeholders with you through clear thinking, confident storytelling and inspiring ideas.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This isn&#39;t primarily a traditional advertising campaign or production-design role. It&#39;s an opportunity to shape the strategy and creative direction behind PlayStation&#39;s digital products and services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Understand the business challenge - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Interrogate briefs, challenge assumptions and identify the underlying business and customer problems. Connect marketing objectives with customer behaviour to find stronger creative opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Shape positioning and propositions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Use customer research, insights and performance data to help define brand positioning, messaging hierarchies and compelling customer propositions. Turn complex features into meaningful functional and emotional benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop creative and visual direction - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Translate strategy into distinctive visual territories, brand identity concepts and design principles. Work with designers, copywriters and creative specialists to develop ideas that are clear, engaging and unmistakably PlayStation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Create connected digital experiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ensure creative positioning works across PlayStation Store, PlayStation.com, CRM, social and other digital touchpoints, adapting messaging and creative direction to different audiences and stages of the customer journey.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build and sell the idea&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Create high-quality, visually compelling presentations that simplify complex thinking, communicate creative recommendations and inspire stakeholder confidence. Collaborate with the wider team to raise creative standards and share effective ways of working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Around 8+ years&#39; experience in creative design, brand design, digital art direction or a related multidisciplinary creative role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A strong portfolio demonstrating visual creative craft alongside strategic thinking, including brand positioning, customer propositions and creative direction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience using customer insight and research to shape creative strategy and translate positioning into visual identities, creative territories or design systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience developing creative for digital products, services, commerce or customer-facing digital communications - not solely traditional advertising campaigns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong visual storytelling and presentation skills, with experience building and presenting compelling creative proposals to clients or senior stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A collaborative approach, working confidently with designers, copywriters and other specialists to bring ideas to life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Curiosity about popular culture, entertainment, technology and how audiences discover, consume and engage with content.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Desirable: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience in gaming, entertainment, or consumer technology sectors&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience working in both agency and in-house creative teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience developing creative frameworks or pitching methodologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Familiarity with digital marketing, performance marketing or customer engagement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience working alongside Creative Directors, Design Directors or Creative Leads, with an ambition to develop into a broader creative leadership role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Familiarity with digital retail, performance marketing, or personalization (DCO)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary bonus opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental Scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday per year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On Site Gym&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised Café&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free soft drinks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
