&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Possess the versatility to effectively collaborate within a team setting and the initiative to autonomously drive projects to completion with minimal supervision&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to craft and present&amp;nbsp;conclusive, data-driven reports&amp;nbsp;that drive action and targeted outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Proficient with querying relational databases (e.g., SQL), big data service (e.g., Redshift, Omni, Snowflake or Big Query)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with the AAA Games Cheating/Security landscape, and a passion for protecting player experiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
