&lt;p&gt;Experience designing or overseeing&amp;nbsp;monitoring, alerting, and observability solutions, including dashboarding platforms such as&amp;nbsp;Grafana or equivalent tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
