&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;PlayStation Store is a multibillion-dollar global digital commerce platform at the center of how players discover, buy, and enjoy content - and this role shapes how the Store catalogue is planned, prioritised, and promoted. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;As the&amp;nbsp;Senior Manager, Catalogue Planning, you will set the strategy, experimentation and planning approach for the PlayStation Store catalogue, connecting title roadmaps, promotional moments, and commercial priorities into a clear global plan. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;This role reports to the Senior Director, Planning &amp;amp; Proposition and leads the Catalogue Planning team of 2 people.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define catalogue and promotional strategy.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the annual and quarterly approach for managing and monetising the Store catalogue, setting clear commercial objectives, principles, KPIs, and guardrails for promotional activity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the integrated catalogue plan.&lt;/strong&gt; Translate DGM and partner roadmaps, revenue forecasts, contractual commitments, and activity requests into a prioritised central plan, master calendar, and sequenced delivery roadmap.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Govern priorities and execution readiness.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead quarterly priority planning and promotional calendars.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead experimentation and learning.&lt;/strong&gt; Direct the promotions experimentation agenda with Analytics, Data Science and other partners; define hypotheses and measures, evaluate results, and scale learning into catalogue and promotion decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate cross-functional delivery.&lt;/strong&gt; Align cross-functional teams on support levels, customer journeys, localisation, dependencies, and market-specific needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the team and operating model.&lt;/strong&gt; Manage and develop the Catalogue Planning team members; clarify accountabilities, improve planning standards, and use automation to remove manual coordination and increase output quality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;A minimum of 10+ years of experience in strategy, operations, pricing &amp;amp; promotions or ecommerce roles, ideally within technology, retail, media, or digital entertainment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;A proven record of setting promotional strategy and translating it into measurable revenue, conversion, engagement, or customer-value outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated people leadership, including building capability, setting clear accountabilities, and creating a high-performing, inclusive team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Advanced analytical judgement: able to interpret complex commercial and customer data, distinguish signal from noise, and use experimentation to make decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Strong planning and programme leadership across annual, quarterly, and in-quarter cycles, with disciplined governance of priorities, dependencies, capacity, and delivery risk.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to influence senior stakeholders and lead across global and local teams in a complex matrix organisation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Crisp executive communication, commercial curiosity, resilience, and a bias for action and measurable outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience managing a large digital-content catalogue or marketplace, including title lifecycle, discoverability, and merchandising choices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with digital promotions, pricing mechanics, segmentation, and test-and-learn programmes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of games, subscription, media, or other partner-led content ecosystems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Global-local fluency and experience balancing enterprise standards with regional and market-specific requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Higher education in Business, Marketing, Economics, Data Science, Analytics, or a related discipline is a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary bonus opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental Scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday per year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On Site Gym&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised Café&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free soft drinks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On site bar&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to cycle garage and showers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Job Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced Senior Integration Engineering Manager to lead and evolve PlayStation’s Enterprise Integration Engineering capability. We deliver reusable, scalable, and loosely coupled integrations that simplify and automate business processes, improving user experience and data quality across the enterprise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In this role, you will define the technical direction, engineering practices, and delivery strategy for our enterprise integration platforms (MuleSoft &amp;amp; SnapLogic), while leading and developing a high-performing team of integration engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will be accountable for engineering strategy, delivery outcomes, technical quality and operational excellence. Working collaboratively with global engineering teams, engineering leaders &amp;amp; managers, architecture, business stakeholders and PMO, to ensure integration solutions are delivered on time, to a high standard of quality, scalability, reliability, and security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will bring a strong technical foundation in integration design and delivery. Actively contribute to integration architecture and design discussions, provide technical leadership, and constructively challenge solutions where needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will mentor and develop engineers, foster a strong engineering team culture, and lead the growth of the Enterprise Integration Engineering capability at PlayStation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Define the technical roadmap for the enterprise integration platforms, ensuring they continue to meet current and future business needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Evaluate emerging integration technologies and industry trends, recommending strategic investments where appropriate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead and guide the design of enterprise integration solutions across MuleSoft and SnapLogic, ensuring solutions are scalable, secure, reusable, and aligned to enterprise standards&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Review and constructively challenge integration designs, patterns, and technical decisions, providing clear direction to improve quality, resilience, and maintainability&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive adoption of modern integration approaches, including API-led, event-driven, pub-sub, asynchronous, and batch/data integration patterns&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Define and promote integration standards, design principles, and reusable patterns across the team&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Be the escalation point for operational and technical issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Engineering Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own delivery across a portfolio of integration initiatives, ensuring commitments are met to agreed timelines, scope, quality, and business outcomes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Determine resource allocation, platform investment, and delivery priorities across multiple concurrent initiatives, balancing technical debt and operational risk to achieve business objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Define and continually improve the engineering operating model, delivery processes, and engineering metrics to increase delivery predictability, platform reliability, and operational excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead the team to solve complex technical and delivery challenges, ensuring issues are identified early and resolved effectively&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure integrations are secure, scalable, resilient, and observable, with appropriate logging, monitoring, error handling, and operational support models.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People &amp;amp; Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Line manage a team of integration engineers, including goal setting, performance management, coaching, and career development.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop senior engineers and future technical leaders through coaching, mentoring, and structured career development.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive an inclusive engineering culture focused on accountability, innovation, collaboration and continuous improvement.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead hiring, onboarding, and organisational planning to build a scalable, high-performing engineering organisation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build strong working relationships across global engineering teams and delivery partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;10+ years of experience designing and delivering enterprise integrations across one or more integration platforms (e.g. Informatica, Dell Boomi, Oracle Service Bus, or similar)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;5+ years of hands-on integration design and development experience on MuleSoft and/or SnapLogic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong technical understanding of enterprise integration architecture, patterns, and platform capabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven experience leading and developing high-performing engineering teams, including senior engineers and technical leads.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven experience reviewing technical design decisions, and providing constructive guidance to improve solution quality.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience working with AWS-hosted integration environments, including messaging services such as SQS and SNS&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with engineering delivery practices and tooling such as GitHub, Jenkins, Maven, and Terraform&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience integrating enterprise SaaS (e.g. Salesforce, Workday), cloud-hosted COTS (e.g. SAP) and custom in-house developed and hosted applications.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to balance technical leadership, delivery accountability, and people management responsibilities&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to present complex technical information clearly and concisely to engineering teams, senior stakeholders, and non-technical audiences&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong stakeholder management and collaboration skills&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Exposure to emerging integration approaches such as MCP servers and agentic-based integrations is desirable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At SIE, we consider several factors when setting each role’s base pay range, including the competitive benchmarking data for the market and geographic location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the base pay range may vary in line with our hybrid working policy and individual base pay will be determined based on job-related factors which may include knowledge, skills, experience, and location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition, this role&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;is eligible&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;for SIE’s top-tier benefits package that includes paid time off, wellness program and coveted employee discounts for Sony products.&amp;nbsp;This role also may be eligible for a bonus package.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Click&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.playstation.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The estimated base pay range for this role is listed below.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€111.800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€167.600 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the&amp;nbsp;Senior&amp;nbsp;Director,&amp;nbsp;People Experience&amp;nbsp;EMEA&amp;nbsp;and is part of&amp;nbsp;the global&amp;nbsp;PX&amp;nbsp;team. The role will be looking&amp;nbsp;after for all&amp;nbsp;operational elements of HR and&amp;nbsp;is part of the core foundation to the success of our HR Operating model and enables us to continue to build&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;smooth and efficient&amp;nbsp;employee experiences. Successful candidates will have worked in similar sized organisations with a remit of multiple countries.&amp;nbsp;The remit is currently growing as we are centralising European Tier 1 activity into the&amp;nbsp;center.&amp;nbsp;The team consists of focused Advisory teams based in London as well as HR Managers who have hybrid roles (Tier 1 and Tier 2) based in France,&amp;nbsp;Germany&amp;nbsp;and Spain.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable&amp;nbsp;for all activity associated with&amp;nbsp;first line&amp;nbsp;HR support (Tier 1), this includes:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;data integrity which feeds into Payroll&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;reporting. Key&amp;nbsp;HR&amp;nbsp;systems are Workday and ServiceNow (Nexus&amp;nbsp;tickets);&amp;nbsp;implement&amp;nbsp;HR policies consistently,&amp;nbsp;oversee&amp;nbsp;country specific&amp;nbsp;onboarding,&amp;nbsp;offboarding, benefit administration,&amp;nbsp;, administration of employee changes&amp;nbsp;(starter, leaver, changes), employee screening,&amp;nbsp;Right to Work checks,&amp;nbsp;HR compliance, Tier&amp;nbsp;1&amp;nbsp;ticketing SLAs&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;continuous&amp;nbsp;process&amp;nbsp;improvement and&amp;nbsp;tech stack&amp;nbsp;automation focus&amp;nbsp;across the region.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain strong relationships with key roles in the wider HR team such as PX Consultants, in-house Legal team,&amp;nbsp;Payroll team,&amp;nbsp;Global Mobility,&amp;nbsp;PTS (technology),&amp;nbsp;COEs (Talent, DEI, Total Rewards etc) as well as regional leaders to ensure you have a deep understanding of business needs and ability to schedule team resource. The key is to continuously improve and develop operational support best practice and review opportunities for improvement with a global lens even when the role is regional.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In partnership with the&amp;nbsp;Senior&amp;nbsp;Director&amp;nbsp;People&amp;nbsp;Experience&amp;nbsp;and senior stakeholders, scope requirements for HR Operations across Europe with the aim to&amp;nbsp;establish&amp;nbsp;and maintain a full European HR Operations service. Countries&amp;nbsp;currently in scope&amp;nbsp;include France, Germany, Netherlands,&amp;nbsp;Belgium,&amp;nbsp;Spain, Portugal,&amp;nbsp;Italy,&amp;nbsp;UK&amp;nbsp;and Ireland&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the&amp;nbsp;team’s&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;adoption&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;successful&amp;nbsp;achievement of&amp;nbsp;current SLAs and KPIs on the Nexus ticketing system,&amp;nbsp;goals&amp;nbsp;and continuous improvement projects&amp;nbsp;to align with changing business needs and re-establish a customer focused and proactive approach across the team&amp;nbsp;and line&amp;nbsp;with the globalisation of our function.&amp;nbsp;Coach, develop&amp;nbsp;and train team members to avoid single point dependencies and&amp;nbsp;build for&amp;nbsp;scale&amp;nbsp;and knowledge sharing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;relevant external supplier relationships and regularly review their SLAs&amp;nbsp;(e.g.&amp;nbsp;pre-employment screening,&amp;nbsp;Right to Work checks&amp;nbsp;etc)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;well as the budget related to yearly activities for Tier1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present regular&amp;nbsp;reports to leadership&amp;nbsp;to illustrate KPIs, changes in processes/policies, noticeable&amp;nbsp;trends&amp;nbsp;and project&amp;nbsp;updates&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;reflective&amp;nbsp;learnings&amp;nbsp;as well as proactive&amp;nbsp;forward looking&amp;nbsp;focal&amp;nbsp;points.&amp;nbsp;This role requires strong collaboration communication skills.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build mechanisms&amp;nbsp;to enable a self-service culture by ensuring core platforms are regularly reviewed and&amp;nbsp;maintained&amp;nbsp;including knowledge articles and regularly reviewing training material for the team and the business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads a continuous improvement culture, driving ongoing development, evaluation/testing, and maintenance of processes and documentation (e.g., Tier 0 Knowledge Base, Standard Operating Procedures).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead projects to improve processes and technology e.g. implementing screening, integrating new work streams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain&amp;nbsp;appropriate confidentiality&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;all of&amp;nbsp;the above, ensuring legal and compliance requirements are met (e.g. employment legislation, data protection etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of managing an operational HR services function with multi-site accountability&amp;nbsp;across EMEA, with specifically working with SLAs/KPIs through a ticketing system&amp;nbsp;and managing a team of 5-10&amp;nbsp;direct reports.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven line management capability with a focus on driving performance,&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;development,&amp;nbsp;continuous&amp;nbsp;improvement as well as evolve the model as centralisation progresses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing&amp;nbsp;new technologies&amp;nbsp;and/or harmonising multiple systems&amp;nbsp;and simplify / automate processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience of building collaborative relationships across the business and HR to gain a detailed understanding of commercial drivers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written, verbal&amp;nbsp;and numeracy skills with the ability to present to senior stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyse data/information and interpret it into recommendations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong eye for detail with a pragmatic approach to solving problems&amp;nbsp;and working well under pressure with&amp;nbsp;multiple project deliveries at any one time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong IT skills with a focus on Microsoft Office and HRIS such as Workday.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven HR&amp;nbsp;advisory&amp;nbsp;experience and can provide advice associated with employment regulations and procedures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management experience in complex matrix global organisations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transformational HR experience across multiple countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked with in the Tech or Gaming industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree level education or CIPD qualified.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary bonus opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid Working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On Site Gym&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised Café&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free soft drinks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On site bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to cycle garage and showers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;430&quot; data-end=&quot;833&quot;&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is seeking an experienced and collaborative Regional Security Manager to lead physical security operations across the Americas (AMER) region. Reporting to the Director, Global Security Operations, this role will oversee a team responsible for regional security programs, incident response, crisis support, and operational readiness across SIE offices, studios, and events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;835&quot; data-end=&quot;1124&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate brings strong operational leadership, sound judgment, and the ability to build trusted partnerships across a global organization. This position plays a key role in helping create safe, secure, and resilient environments for employees, visitors, and business operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1j5ac4d&quot; data-start=&quot;1126&quot; data-end=&quot;1144&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1145&quot; data-end=&quot;1177&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1145&quot; data-end=&quot;1177&quot;&gt;Regional Security Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1178&quot; data-end=&quot;1696&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wwvqat&quot; data-start=&quot;1178&quot; data-end=&quot;1262&quot;&gt;Lead and support a regional team of security professionals across the AMER region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1krr0bo&quot; data-start=&quot;1263&quot; data-end=&quot;1376&quot;&gt;Partner with global security teams to help maintain consistent standards, processes, and operational practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vkl03y&quot; data-start=&quot;1377&quot; data-end=&quot;1488&quot;&gt;Contribute to the development and execution of regional security strategies aligned with business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16ekiz5&quot; data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1597&quot;&gt;Use metrics and operational insights to evaluate effectiveness and identify opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13j44kg&quot; data-start=&quot;1598&quot; data-end=&quot;1696&quot;&gt;Support budget planning, resource management, and vendor oversight within the security function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1698&quot; data-end=&quot;1730&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1698&quot; data-end=&quot;1730&quot;&gt;Physical Security Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1731&quot; data-end=&quot;2286&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;54dj91&quot; data-start=&quot;1731&quot; data-end=&quot;1830&quot;&gt;Oversee physical security programs, policies, and procedures across offices and studio locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;uyta6q&quot; data-start=&quot;1831&quot; data-end=&quot;1940&quot;&gt;Conduct risk assessments and coordinate security reviews to identify and address potential vulnerabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tbwsjx&quot; data-start=&quot;1941&quot; data-end=&quot;2059&quot;&gt;Collaborate with internal stakeholders and external partners to strengthen site security and emergency preparedness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ljpbi7&quot; data-start=&quot;2060&quot; data-end=&quot;2182&quot;&gt;Manage third-party security providers to ensure quality service delivery and alignment with organizational expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xqaw74&quot; data-start=&quot;2183&quot; data-end=&quot;2286&quot;&gt;Provide guidance and operational support to regional sites on security best practices and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2288&quot; data-end=&quot;2318&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2288&quot; data-end=&quot;2318&quot;&gt;Incident &amp;amp; Crisis Response&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2319&quot; data-end=&quot;2826&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bn2lc7&quot; data-start=&quot;2319&quot; data-end=&quot;2406&quot;&gt;Lead or support responses to workplace security incidents and safety-related matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18ym1uq&quot; data-start=&quot;2407&quot; data-end=&quot;2525&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Workplace, Legal, HR/People, and other teams to support investigations and incident management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1saltol&quot; data-start=&quot;2526&quot; data-end=&quot;2628&quot;&gt;Prepare clear documentation, reporting, and recommendations following incidents or security reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gst6j0&quot; data-start=&quot;2629&quot; data-end=&quot;2719&quot;&gt;Support emergency planning activities, tabletop exercises, and preparedness initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;x1grdk&quot; data-start=&quot;2720&quot; data-end=&quot;2826&quot;&gt;Coordinate response efforts during significant incidents impacting employees, facilities, or operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2828&quot; data-end=&quot;2846&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2828&quot; data-end=&quot;2846&quot;&gt;Event Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2847&quot; data-end=&quot;3140&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d0kw7t&quot; data-start=&quot;2847&quot; data-end=&quot;2964&quot;&gt;Support security planning and operational readiness for PlayStation events, activations, and executive engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ciu9w9&quot; data-start=&quot;2965&quot; data-end=&quot;3051&quot;&gt;Conduct event-related risk assessments and coordinate appropriate security measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;aku2ac&quot; data-start=&quot;3052&quot; data-end=&quot;3140&quot;&gt;Provide on-site leadership and incident management support during key regional events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3142&quot; data-end=&quot;3175&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3142&quot; data-end=&quot;3175&quot;&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3176&quot; data-end=&quot;3528&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19ma2vd&quot; data-start=&quot;3176&quot; data-end=&quot;3277&quot;&gt;Build strong partnerships with teams across HR, IT, Workplace, Legal, and other business functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1t43hp7&quot; data-start=&quot;3278&quot; data-end=&quot;3380&quot;&gt;Communicate regularly with leadership regarding security priorities, risks, and operational updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lcchsw&quot; data-start=&quot;3381&quot; data-end=&quot;3528&quot;&gt;Maintain relationships with industry peers, security organizations, and external partners to stay informed on emerging trends and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;ebiqzw&quot; data-start=&quot;3530&quot; data-end=&quot;3556&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3557&quot; data-end=&quot;4380&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bdrbh&quot; data-start=&quot;3557&quot; data-end=&quot;3732&quot;&gt;8+ years of experience in physical security, corporate security operations, investigations, law enforcement, military, intelligence, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uqxn0e&quot; data-start=&quot;3733&quot; data-end=&quot;3826&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience managing security initiatives across multiple locations or regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wat937&quot; data-start=&quot;3827&quot; data-end=&quot;3917&quot;&gt;Strong leadership and people management skills, including coaching and team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;crk8cn&quot; data-start=&quot;3918&quot; data-end=&quot;4028&quot;&gt;Ability to assess complex situations, make informed decisions, and communicate effectively during incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uym8ae&quot; data-start=&quot;4029&quot; data-end=&quot;4124&quot;&gt;Excellent collaboration and stakeholder management skills across diverse teams and functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a6gb4e&quot; data-start=&quot;4125&quot; data-end=&quot;4203&quot;&gt;Experience managing vendors, contractors, or third-party security providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;daqbey&quot; data-start=&quot;4204&quot; data-end=&quot;4292&quot;&gt;Familiarity with crisis management, emergency response, and event security operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dz6z7x&quot; data-start=&quot;4293&quot; data-end=&quot;4380&quot;&gt;Flexibility to support occasional evening/weekend work and regional travel as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;fktgjl&quot; data-start=&quot;4382&quot; data-end=&quot;4410&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4411&quot; data-end=&quot;4755&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1h90c8i&quot; data-start=&quot;4411&quot; data-end=&quot;4503&quot;&gt;Experience in technology, gaming, entertainment, or other fast-paced global organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hjwhpd&quot; data-start=&quot;4504&quot; data-end=&quot;4601&quot;&gt;Industry certifications such as CPP (Certified Protection Professional) or similar credentials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pvljpv&quot; data-start=&quot;4602&quot; data-end=&quot;4755&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Criminal Justice, Security Management, Emergency Management, Business, or a related field — or equivalent professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
