&lt;li&gt;Define and craft integration tests with Test Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve performance and reliability issues at a global scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage and fix reported bugs&lt;/li&gt;
