&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a&amp;nbsp;senior position at the core of PlayStation GPU technology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;with an&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;unusual&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;degree of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;influence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;on&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;future of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;graphics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;-programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;ATG is granted a high degree of trust and autonomy in shaping the graphics software stack and we are looking for people&amp;nbsp;who are passionate about carrying this forward.&amp;nbsp;You will not be spending your time in committee meetings&amp;nbsp;or writing endless proposals, this is very much an engineering role where your primary role is to&amp;nbsp;determine&amp;nbsp;what needs to be implemented, how best to implement it and to&amp;nbsp;then sit down,&amp;nbsp;code, debug. We believe that this practical focus is crucial in building up the skill, experience, and insight&amp;nbsp;required&amp;nbsp;to make the large-scale and long-term decisions we have been entrusted with.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
