&lt;li style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Solid experience writing automated tests in Python, JavaScript, C ++ or any other Programming Language&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience with Selenium or Appium or UI Automation technologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
