&lt;li style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Strong technical, analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Able to work efficiently as part of a team and independently&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Strong initiative and outstanding verbal and written communication skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
