&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Analysis of customer requirements to produce maintainable designs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
