&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience developing cross-platform applications for Windows, Linux, and macOS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with PostgreSQL or other relational databases&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
