&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #424242 !important;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #424242;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;Participate in senior recruiting and key leadership interviews.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #424242 !important;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #424242;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;Define global workforce and succession plans for the sound function.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #424242 !important;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #424242;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;Build a culture of performance, development, and mentorship across the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #424242 !important;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;
