&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #424242;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;15+ years of audio leadership experience within AAA game development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #424242 !important;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #424242;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;Minimum of 6 shipped AAA games in a senior sound leadership role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #424242 !important;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #424242;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;Proven record of managing, mentoring, and inspiring high-performing sound teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #424242 !important;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #424242;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in interactive audio, post-production, and advanced authoring tools (Wwise, FMOD, or proprietary engines).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #424242 !important;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #424242;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of multidisciplinary development workflows (animation, level design, AI, physics, mechanics).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #424242 !important;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #424242;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;Exceptional executive communication, presentation, and organizational leadership skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #424242 !important;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #424242;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;History of delivering innovative, high-quality sound experiences under tight time constraints.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #424242 !important;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #424242;&quot; data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative, visionary leader with a passion for pushing audio boundaries in gaming.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
